# Firmware Conventions

- Independent from `software/` — C++ / PlatformIO, not pnpm
- HTTP only: `GET /api/dogs/:dogId/state`, `POST .../events`, `POST .../clear`
- Send `X-API-Key` header; omit `timestamp` on button POSTs (server assigns now)
- Parse `lastOutAt` as ISO 8601 string; no Temporal or shared TS types
- Config in `include/config.h` (gitignored); template in `config.example.h`
- Build with `pio run` from `firmware/esp32-clock/`
